# Titan 2 Elite, Uyghur layout, long-press modifier Shift with a threshold below 1000 ms.
# Shift+L types the two letters لا; a long press with Shift held switches to the lower layer and
# replaces both letters with ل. The next key types a plain letter: no Shift is left over.
require profile titan2elite_qwerty
require layout uyghur
hw press B
hw hold SHIFT_RIGHT
hw hold L
wait 1000
hw release L
hw release SHIFT_RIGHT
expect بل
hw press D
expect بلد
